OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA few showers possible this
OL,6,Fmorning, particularly in the north,
OL,7,Fbut a dry and sunny start elsewhere. A
OL,8,Flittle fair weather cloud will bubble
OL,9,Fup this afternoon, but still plenty of
OL,10,Fwarm sunny spells.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FStaying dry tonight with
OL,13,Fclear skies. A few mist patches are
OL,14,Fpossible in places, and feeling cool
OL,15,Fin the countryside.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FA dry day on Sunday and
OL,18,Ffeeling very warm in the sunny spells.
OL,19,FSome patchy cloud developing in the
OL,20,Fafternoon, but still plenty of
OL,21,Fsunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
